/* 区域探索事件库 卷3 / 温室·黑铁·石环·天鹅绒 / 零编号命名 */
:: MP Region Glasshouse TerraceSundialLetter [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">>
<<effects>>
玻璃穹顶露台东侧的石雕日晷盘下压着一只防水羊皮信封，晷针可以左右扳动。
<<mpAmbient>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨声掩去了响动。<<else>>四周静谧无声。<</if>>
你扳动晷针，日晷盘下露出信封，封口火漆印着一枚小望远镜。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[抽出信封 (0:05)|MP Region Glasshouse Dome]]>><<pass 5>><<stress -3>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<link [[拆开信封 (0:06)|MP Region Glasshouse Dome]]>><<pass 6>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<skulduggery 2>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_glasshouse_terracesundialletter_reward")>><<money 1104>><</if>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_region_ev_glasshouse_terracesundialletter")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>><<else>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>><</if>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">拆开信封 (0:06)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回温室 (0:02)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 2>><<stress -1>><</link>><<lstress>>

:: MP Region Glasshouse IceCellarBrassCan [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">>
<<effects>>
地下酿造室南角的石砌冰窖里存着几块未融的坚冰，冰块下方冻着一只密封的黄铜罐。
<<mpAmbient>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜深无人察觉。<<else>>光线照亮了纹理。<</if>>
你凿开罐周的冰，铜罐封盖下压着一圈麻布，罐身刻着酿造批号。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[敲薄冰面 (0:05)|MP Region Glasshouse Cellar]]>><<pass 5>><<stress -3>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link [[撬开封盖 (0:07)|MP Region Glasshouse Cellar]]>><<pass 7>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<skulduggery 2>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_glasshouse_icecellarbrasscan_reward")>><<money 452>><</if>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_region_ev_glasshouse_icecellarbrasscan")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>><<else>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>><</if>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">撬开封盖 (0:07)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回温室 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -1>><</link>><<lstress>>

:: MP Region Blackiron WaterTowerToolbag [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "elk">>
<<effects>>
废弃调车场西端的给水塔铁梯下拴着一只防水工具包，水塔阀门正一滴滴往下漏水。
<<mpAmbient>><<if Weather.isFreezing>>微凉水雾在往下漏水表面结了薄霜。<<else>>空气里带着微温。<</if>>
你解开铁梯下的工具包，扳手间夹着一只油布小袋，袋里是几枚零钱。
