:: MP Region Velvet ChaiseCoralPurse [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">>
<<effects>>
镜面试衣沙龙的丝绒贵妃榻扶手下塞着一只金丝小手包，搭扣嵌着红珊瑚。
<<mpAmbient>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜深无人察觉。<<else>>光线照亮了纹理。<</if>>
你从贵妃榻扶手下勾出手包，搭扣上的红珊瑚松了一颗，包里还有几枚银币。
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[勾出金丝包 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Salon]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -3>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<link [[撬下珊瑚 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Salon]]>><<pass 8>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<skulduggery 2>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_velvet_chaisecoralpurse_reward")>><<money 764>><</if>><<stress -4>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_region_ev_velvet_chaisecoralpurse")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>><<else>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>><</if>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">撬下珊瑚 (0:08)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回天鹅绒厅 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -1>><</link>><<lstress>>

:: MP Region Velvet PlanterSilverCase [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">>
<<effects>>
露台观海雅座的大理石花盆下压着半块防水油布，里面裹着一只扁平的银烟盒。
<<mpAmbient>><<if Weather.isFreezing>>微凉水雾在的银烟盒表面结了薄霜。<<else>>空气里带着微温。<</if>>
你掀开大理石花盆，油布里的银烟盒还能打开，盒中夹着一张露台座次表。
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[掀开花盆 (0:05)|MP Region Velvet Terrace]]>><<pass 5>><<stress -3>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>
